@startuml
title ASUC-02 / ASUC-03: Laptop Insights and Fail-Soft Recommendation
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
actor Shopper
boundary "React Web UI" as UI
control "FastAPI Insights Endpoint" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
control "Discount and Advice Rules" as Rule
Shopper -> UI : Open laptop details
UI -> API : GET /products/{id}/insights
par Current and historical prices
  API -> DB : Read comparable offers and 30-day history
  DB --> API : Valid observations, currencies, times
else Pre-computed forecast
  API -> DB : Read latest stored forecast / model version
  DB --> API : Forecast or NULL, generated_at
end
API -> Rule : Evaluate reference delta, forecast age and trend
alt Fresh forecast + sufficient evidence
  Rule --> API : BUY NOW / WAIT / INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE + reasons
else Forecast stale or absent
  Rule --> API : Rules-only caution or INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE
end
API --> UI : JSON: present, past, future, recommendation, caveats
UI --> Shopper : Display price chart and explicit uncertainty
note over API,DB
  No synchronous heavy model execution.
  DB unavailable: dependency error without a separate cache.
end note
@enduml
